# Final Recommendation

## Master These First

### Tier 1 (Highest Priority)
- ML Fundamentals
- Data Preprocessing
- Linear Regression
- Logistic Regression
- Decision Trees
- Random Forest
- KNN
- Naive Bayes
- SVM
- Clustering
- PCA
- Model Evaluation
- Bias-Variance
- Cross Validation
- Regularization

### Tier 2 (High Priority)
- Gradient Descent
- Learning Rate
- Feature Engineering
- Feature Scaling
- Ensemble Learning
- XGBoost
- Hyperparameter Tuning
- Pipelines

### Tier 3 (Good to Know)
- Statistics
- Probability
- Data Leakage
- Explainable AI
- Imbalanced Datasets

For **AI/ML Fresher interviews**, mastering **Tier 1 + Tier 2** and having a working understanding of **Tier 3** is sufficient for the majority of product-based companies and startups.
